    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have learned to shake off debilitating conditions.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Endurance\" title=\"Endurance\">Endurance</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can spend two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> instead of three to move +1 step along the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> It takes three <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> to move +1 step up along the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.</p>",
